DTSTAMP:20260819T232627Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/andruw-thompson/
SUMMARY:Andruw Thompson
DESCRIPTION:\nAndruw Thompson is a Michigan-born singer\, guitarist\, and e
 ntertainer shaped by years of performing on Nashville’s Broadway\, inclu
 ding more than three years at the legendary Tootsie’s Orchid Lounge.\n\n
 \n\nBlending powerhouse vocals\, blues-driven guitar\, country\, rock\, an
 d soul\, Thompson has built his live show around one thing: making the cro
 wd part of it. After years of playing packed Nashville rooms night after n
 ight\, he’s bringing that same high-energy\, anything-can-happen atmosph
 ere to Asheville.\n\n\n\nExpect big vocals\, guitar-driven favorites\, une
 xpected requests\, singalongs\, and a show that changes depending on the r
 oom.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/08/andruwthompson2.jpg
END:VEVENT
