URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/bluegrass-brunch-5-2026-09-27/
SUMMARY:BLUEGRASS BRUNCH
DESCRIPTION:\nJack’s Bluegrass Brunch kicks off every Sunday at noon with
  toe-tappin' tunes courtesy of The Bluegrass Brunch Boys — featuring som
 e of Asheville's finest musicians\, including ANDREW WAKEFIELD\, JAMES SCH
 LENDER\, ADAM BACHMAN\, &amp\; ZACHARY DYKE — going until 2pm!\n\n\n\nKi
 ck your Sunday Funday off right with a Bloody Mary or mimosa while enjoyin
 g the live music and indulging in our delicious menu of brunch dishes (ser
 ved until 3pm) and pub favorites.\n\n\n\nOur classic pub fare menu resumes
  at 3:00\, with our TRADITIONAL IRISH MUSIC SESSION beginning at 3:30 — 
 and going until close!&nbsp\;Sláinte\, y’all!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 5/11/JOTW_SUN-BluegrassBrunchBoys_2025_IG_1080x1350.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Jack of the Wood
UID:12079@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T210000
DTSTAMP:20260718T213026Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/traditional-irish-music-session-2026-
 09-06-2026-09-13-2026-09-20-2026-09-27/
SUMMARY:TRADITIONAL IRISH MUSIC SESSION
DESCRIPTION:\nJack's long-running Traditional Irish Music Session is the pe
 rfect way to enjoy the Celtic-influenced sounds of talented musicians from
  all over WNC &amp\; further afield!\n\n\n\nStop in to enjoy the music —
  going strong from 3:30pm until close — along with a pint or and Irish
  coffee and the best public house fare in town! \n\n\n\nSláinte\, y'all!\
 n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 5/11/JOTW_SUN-IrishMusicSession_2025_IG_1080x1350.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Jack of the Wood
UID:12098@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T220000
DTSTAMP:20260718T213047Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/old-time-jam-4-2026-09-02-2026-09-09-
 2026-09-16-2026-09-23-2026-09-30/
SUMMARY:OLD-TIME JAM
DESCRIPTION:\nThe roots of Appalachian old-time music stretch far across th
 e Atlantic and we're proud to honor and showcase that legacy at Jack of th
 e Wood Pub with our long-running Old-Time Jam sessions — every Wednesda
 y starting at 5pm! Recently recommended by Rolling Stone for "those lookin
 g for an organic\, participatory [music] experience" in Asheville\, the Ol
 d-Time Jam is one of several weekly traditional jam sessions hosted at JAC
 K.\n\n\n\nOur cozy Celtic pub is the perfect spot downtown to take in some
  of the region's finest traditional acoustic musicians playing "in the rou
 nd" while you enjoy a pint or two and the best pub fare in town!\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 5/09/JOTW_WED-OldTimeJam_2025-RollingStoneQuote_IG_1080x1350.jpg
END:VEVENT
